msgid "%1$s and %2$s are the group-level effect size and standard deviation, respectively."
msgstr "%1$s 和 %2$s 分別是組水平效應量和標準差。"

msgid "%s is the group-level effect size."
msgstr "%s 是組水平效應量。"

msgid "Bayes factor of the random effects H%1$s over the fixed effects H%1$s."
msgstr "隨機效應 H%1$s 相對於固定效應 H%1$s 的貝氏因子。"

msgid "Posterior estimates are based on the models that assume an effect to be present. The Bayes factor is based on all four models: fixed effects H%2$s & random effects H%2$s over the fixed effects H%1$s & random effects H%1$s."
msgstr "後驗估計基於假設存在效應的模型。貝氏因子基於所有四個模型：固定效應 H%2$s 和隨機效應 H%2$s 相對於固定效應 H%1$s 和隨機效應 H%1$s。"

msgid "Model averaged posterior estimates for %3$s are not yet available, but will be added in the future. The Bayes factor is based on all four models: random effects H%1$s & H%2$s over the fixed effects H%1$s & H%2$s."
msgstr "%3$s 的模型平均後驗估計尚不可用，但將在未來加入。貝氏因子基於所有四個模型：隨機效應 H%1$s 和 H%2$s 相對於固定效應 H%1$s 和 H%2$s。"

msgid "Bayes factor of the (unconstrained/constrained) random effects H%1$s over the fixed effects H%1$s."
msgstr "（無約束/有約束）隨機效應 H%1$s 相對於固定效應 H%1$s 的貝氏因子。"

msgid "Bayes factor of the fixed effects H%1$s over the random effects H%1$s."
msgstr "固定效應 H%1$s 相對於隨機效應 H%1$s 的貝氏因子。"

msgid "Model averaged posterior estimates are based on the models that assume an effect to be present. The Bayes factor is based on all four models: fixed effects H%1$s & random effects H%1$s over the fixed effects H%2$s & random effects H%2$s."
msgstr "模型平均後驗估計基於假設存在效應的模型。貝氏因子基於所有四個模型：固定效應 H%1$s 和隨機效應 H%1$s 相對於固定效應 H%2$s 和隨機效應 H%2$s。"

msgid "Model averaged posterior estimates for %3$s are not yet available, but will be added in the future. The Bayes factor is based on all four models: fixed effects H%1$s & H%2$s over the random effects H%1$s & H%2$s."
msgstr "%3$s 的模型平均後驗估計尚不可用，但將在未來加入。貝氏因子基於所有四個模型：固定效應 H%1$s 和 H%2$s 相對於隨機效應 H%1$s 和 H%2$s。"

msgid "Bayes factor of the fixed effects H%1$s over the (unconstrained/constrained) random effects H%1$s."
msgstr "固定效應 H%1$s 相對於（無約束/有約束）隨機效應 H%1$s 的貝氏因子。"

msgid "Bayes factor of the ordered effects H%1$s over the fixed effects H%2$s. The Bayes factor for the ordered effects H%1$s versus the unconstrained (random) effects H%1$s model is %3$.3f."
msgstr "有序效應 H%1$s 相對於固定效應 H%2$s 的貝氏因子。有序效應 H%1$s 相對於無約束（隨機）效應 H%1$s 模型的貝氏因子為 %3$.3f。"

msgid "Bayes factor of the fixed effects H%2$s over the ordered effects H%1$s. The Bayes factor for the unconstrained (random) effects H%1$s versus the ordered effects H%1$s model is %3$.3f."
msgstr "固定效應 H%2$s 相對於有序效應 H%1$s 的貝氏因子。無約束（隨機）效應 H%1$s 相對於有序效應 H%1$s 模型的貝氏因子為 %3$.3f。"

